{"seq":2,"slug":"architectures","title":"架构：让雅可比变得可算的工程巧思","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"coupling-flows","title":"耦合流：把一半变量冻住，换来三角雅可比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/architectures/coupling-flows","wordCount":1543,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"autoregressive-flows","title":"自回归流：一组深刻的对偶——MAF 与 IAF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/architectures/autoregressive-flows","wordCount":1638,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"invertible-blocks","title":"可逆块与 $1\\times1$ 卷积：Glow 如何把流推上高分辨率图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/normalizing-flows/architectures/invertible-blocks","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"架构-让雅可比变得可算的工程巧思\">架构：让雅可比变得可算的工程巧思</h1><p>标准化流的全部工程难度，可以浓缩成一个矛盾：变换要足够灵活才能拟合复杂数据，又要让雅可比行列式与逆变换足够廉价才能训练和采样。一个稠密的可逆神经网络，雅可比行列式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的灾难。这一章讲的三种主流架构，本质都是用结构约束把这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，同时尽量少损失表达力。</p>\n<p>第一篇《耦合流》讲 NICE 与 RealNVP 的核心发明——仿射耦合层：把变量分成两半，一半原样通过、一半被另一半参数化地变换，雅可比自动成为三角阵，行列式退化为对角元之积。第二篇《自回归流》讲 MAF 与 IAF，它们用自回归分解让每个维度只依赖前面的维度，同样得到三角雅可比，但在&quot;密度估计快&quot;与&quot;采样快&quot;之间做出了恰好相反的取舍——理解这对偶性是本章的关键洞见。第三篇《可逆块与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 卷积》讲 Glow 如何用 actnorm、可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 卷积、多尺度结构把耦合流推上高分辨率图像生成。</p>\n<p>三篇之间是&quot;变体—对偶—集成&quot;的关系：耦合流是最易上手的基石，自回归流揭示了流设计中一组深刻的对偶，Glow 则示范了如何把这些块拼成能打的完整系统。所有这些架构为何都追求三角雅可比，背后的行列式数学在第三章<a href=\"../jacobian/jacobian-determinant\">雅可比行列式技巧</a>详述；本章聚焦&quot;怎么搭&quot;，那里聚焦&quot;为什么算得快&quot;。</p>\n"}